### Installing 

1) Open `whale://extensions` 

2) Select 'install unpacked extension (압축 해제 된 앱 로드)'

![image.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/naver/whale-developers/master/docs/e0d26564-0e2c-11e7-94b1-6d47c4edead0.png)

3) Select extension folder 

![image.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/naver/whale-developers/master/docs/f11076b4-0e2c-11e7-993b-3aba86b416e3.png)

4) Confirm extension loaded

![image.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/naver/whale-developers/master/docs/0a3101a4-0e2d-11e7-8eb5-0fb2bab6ba77.png)


### Debugging
* When debugging sidebar extension, right click on sidebar and select `Inspect` on context menu
![image.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/naver/whale-developers/master/docs/40bc5c1e-0e2d-11e7-80ec-4137936a3bff.png)

* When debugging background page
  * Open `whale://inspect`
  * Select 'Extension' > 'Extension development (개발중인 익스텐션)`
  * Developer tools > 'Source' tab > select background script to debug
![image.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/naver/whale-developers/master/docs/7fa170fe-0e2d-11e7-9402-538293aacb71.png)

* When debugging content script
  * If you are injecting any js or css using content script,
![image.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/naver/whale-developers/master/docs/25eb21f8-0e2e-11e7-8c6f-1c71d9cfab07.png)
  * Open the Developer tools
  * 'Source' tab > 'Ctrl+O' > select script resource to content script debug
![image.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/naver/whale-developers/master/docs/5dcfef0e-0e2e-11e7-9527-cabe957718d3.png)
  * You can access to the source code injected from the extension
![image.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/naver/whale-developers/master/docs/74c4ad62-0e2e-11e7-9831-c77bfa0808f9.png)=== HOME WIKI ===
